tinkersreborn.tool.pickaxe=Pickaxe
tinkersreborn.tool.pickaxe.desc=The Pickaxe is a precise mining tool. It is effective on stone and ores.\nIt breaks blocks, OK?
tinkersreborn.tool.shovel=Shovel
tinkersreborn.tool.shovel.desc=The Shovel digs up dirt. It is effective on dirt, sand, gravel and snow.\nJust don't dig your own grave!
tinkersreborn.tool.hatchet=Hatchet
tinkersreborn.tool.hatchet.desc=The Hatchet chops up wood and makes short work of leaves. It also makes for a passable weapon.\nChop chop!
tinkersreborn.tool.kama=Kama
tinkersreborn.tool.kama.desc=The Kama is a versatile farming tool, mowing down plants, tilling soil and shearing animals.\nRight Click: Hoe ground, harvest and replant crops
tinkersreborn.tool.mattock=Mattock
tinkersreborn.tool.mattock.desc=The Mattock is a precise multi-use tool. It is effective on wood, soil and plants. It also creates paths like shovels and packs quite a punch.\nRight Click: Create path
tinkersreborn.tool.hammer=Hammer
tinkersreborn.tool.hammer.desc=The Hammer is a broad mining tool. It harvests blocks in a wide range.\nAlso effective against undead.
tinkersreborn.tool.excavator=Excavator
tinkersreborn.tool.excavator.desc=The Excavator is a broad digging tool. It digs up large areas of soil and snow in a wide range.\nTerraforming!
tinkersreborn.tool.lumberaxe=Lumberaxe
tinkersreborn.tool.lumberaxe.desc=The Lumber Axe is a broad chopping tool. It can fell entire trees in one swoop or gather wood in a wide range.\nTimber!
tinkersreborn.tool.scythe=Scythe
tinkersreborn.tool.scythe.desc=The Scythe is a broad reaping tool, mowing down plants and foes alike.\nHas an AOE Attack.\nRight Click: Harvest and replant crops
tinkersreborn.tool.broadsword=Broadsword
tinkersreborn.tool.broadsword.desc=The Broadsword is a universal weapon. Sweep attacks keep enemy hordes at bay.\nAlso good against cobwebs!
tinkersreborn.tool.longsword=Longsword
tinkersreborn.tool.longsword.desc=The Longsword is an offensive weapon. It is often used for charging into battle at full speed.\nRight Click: Lunge
tinkersreborn.tool.rapier=Rapier
tinkersreborn.tool.rapier.desc=The Rapier is a special weapon that relies on quick strikes to defeat foes.\nRight Click: Backpedal
tinkersreborn.tool.cleaver=Cleaver
tinkersreborn.tool.cleave.desc=The Cleaver is a heavy offensive weapon. It has powerful strikes, but is difficult to wield.\nCleavers benefit from high damage.\nSlow, requires two hands!
tinkersreborn.tool.veinhammer=Vein Hammer
tinkersreborn.tool.veinhammer.desc=The Vein Hammer is a broad mining tool. It harvests many connected blocks of the same type, perfect for ores.
tinkersreborn.tool.arrow=Arrow
tinkersreborn.tool.arrow.desc=The Arrows are the ammo used for Tinkers' Bows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.
tinkersreborn.tool.bolt=Bolt
tinkersreborn.tool.bolt.desc=The Bolts are the ammo used for Tinkers' Crossbows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.\nPartially penetrates enemy armor.
tinkersreborn.tool.shortbow=Shortbow
tinkersreborn.tool.shortbow.desc=The Shortbow is a quick and nimble weapon. It allows for fast movements while shooting arrows at a rapid rate.\nUses Tinkers' Arrows.
tinkersreborn.tool.longbow=Longbow
tinkersreborn.tool.longbow.desc=The Longbow is a powerful long range weapon. It provides high damage but is less mobile than its short brother.\nUses Tinkers' Arrows.
tinkersreborn.tool.crossbow=Crossbow
tinkersreborn.tool.crossbow.desc=The Crossbow is a slow but very powerful weapon. It has to be loaded beforehand by holding right-click, but can be fired at any moment afterwards.\nUses Tinkers' Bolts.

